            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case centered on whether Dubin\u2019s conduct qualified as aggravated identity theft under 18\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f1028A(a)(1)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
